  "prefLabel": "Lot 8108.02 Cybersecurity Audit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8108.02 Cybersecurity Audit. Pursuant to RSA 284:22-c, IV(g), each ADW provider shall file with the commission by April 15 of each year for the previous calendar year in which ADW was offered a copy of the annual independent third-party cybersecurity audit which shall include, at a minimum, the following:\n\n(a) A PCI attestation of compliance;\n\n(b) A penetration test of all digital platforms, mobile applications, internal, external, and wireless networks to confirm if identified vulnerabilities of all devices, the servers, and applications are susceptible to compromise; and\n\n(c) Recommended corrective action, and remediation plans, if applicable.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot8100.html"
